hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1293","Ahmad bin Abdullah bin Abdul Rahim Al-Barqi told us, Ibn Abi Maryam told me, Othman bin Muktal, and Anas bin Iyad told us They said: Al-Harith bin Abdul-Rahman bin Abi Dhabab told us, on the authority of Abdul-Rahman bin Mahran, the client of Abu Hurairah, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, On the authority of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, he said: “The most beloved of the countries to God is its mosques, and the most hated of the countries to God are its markets.”"
